<dc:description>Background: Xihuang Wan (XHW), a purgative and detoxifying agent, is commonly utilized in modern medicine as a treatment and adjuvant therapy for various malignancies, including breast cancer, liver cancer, and lung cancer.</dc:description>
<dc:subject><rdf:Bag><rdf:li>pancreatic cancer</rdf:li><rdf:li>Xihuang pills</rdf:li><rdf:li>CYP3A4</rdf:li><rdf:li>widely targeted metabolomics</rdf:li><rdf:li>steroid hormone biosynthesis</rdf:li></rdf:Bag></dc:subject>
